<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25035" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακρᾰτ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hold fast, control,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὅπλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phylarch.
					24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ὅλον κόσμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herm.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.15.16
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				4.12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀργάδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					1.79
				</span></i>
			; <i>hold,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ στόματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.152
				</span></i>
			 (
				Pass.
			), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				12.30.3
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hold in possession</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1047 ii 6
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>, 
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>maintain, establish,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Stob.
					1.1.9
				</span></i>
			; <i>retain, preserve,</i> in argument, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				439
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>hold up, support,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱστόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Erot.
				</span></i>
			
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλα; δέπας</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				11.492b
			</span></i>(
				Pass.
			): metaph., <i>support, keep alive,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὑτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					9.43
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>hold back, detain,</i> in 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τῶν χρηστῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					2.8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
